y’Ubuyobozi agomba kuba –
(a) ari inyangamugayo;
(b) atarakatiwe igihano cy’igifungo
kingana cyangwa kirengeje amezi 6
mu rubanza rwabaye ndakuka;
(c) atarahamwe n’icyaha
cy’ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside
n’ibyaha bifitanye isano na yo;
(d) kandi atarahamwe n’icyaha cya
jenoside.

(a) kunganira Guverineri mu gukora
inshingano ze;
(b) gushyira umukono ku noti;
(c) gusimbura Guverineri igihe adahari
cyangwa kuba mu mwanya we igihe
atarashyirwaho;
(d) gukora indi nshingano yahabwa
n’Inama y’Ubuyobozi ifite aho ihuriye
n’inshingano za BNR.

ku mwanya w’umurimo iyo –
(a) manda irangiye;
(b) atacyujuje impamvu zashingiweho
ashyirwa muri uwo mwanya
w’umurimo;
(c) atagishoboye gukora imirimo ye
kubera ubumuga bw’umubiri cyangwa
ubwo mu mutwe, byemejwe
n’umuganga wemewe na Leta;
(d) yeguye;
(e) yirukanwe;
(f) cyangwa apfuye.
